{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>受東北季候風影響，本港早上天氣清涼。</p><p></p><p>早上天色灰暗，不少長者都穿上外套、做足保暖，清晨各區錄得約13至16度，荃灣最低氣溫只有11.9度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1000_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UcftfhJZrh1795228508.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>天文台指，隨著覆蓋華南的廣闊雲帶逐漸遠離，天色會短暫好轉。今日大致多雲及乾燥，日間部分時間有陽光，最高氣溫約20度。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.HKO-1000_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026lTdLDwf3eM1795228542.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>隨著一股達強風程度的偏東氣流，下周初影響華南沿岸，氣溫會略為回升。但下周二，受另一股東北季候風影響，本港氣溫會再度下降及有幾陣雨。</p><p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:03:58.246308+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":194,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T02:02:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T00:33:51.423157+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T02:57:22.310366+00:00","content_hash":"7ef84c306b50c5d50daab0028943102a6a249879da12ca1683e672c8a89d1f57","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T03:03:58.246308+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}